   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat escompt&#xe9; de ce projet est la prestation de services de voyage &#xe0; des experts en la mati&#xe8;re de pays en d&#xe9;veloppement.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcome of this project includes providing travel support to subject matter experts from developing countries.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat obtenu &#xe0; la fin de la mise en &#x153;uvre du projet, en d&#xe9;cembre 2019, a &#xe9;t&#xe9; la prestation de services de voyage &#xe0; 77 experts en la mati&#xe8;re de 37 pays en d&#xe9;veloppement pour qu&apos;ils puissent participer &#xe0; la conf&#xe9;rence.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The result achieved as of the end of project implementation (December 2019) was providing travel support to 77 subject matter experts from 37 developing countries to attend the Conference.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
